        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Pixelate a Still\n\nBreaks an image into large square blocks. Use it to redact faces or text, where a bigger cell size hides more detail.\n\n**How it works:** The \"Image\" input goes to \"Pixelate\", which averages each 16 by 16 pixel cell into one color. \"Result\" shows the pixelated image. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Raise cell_size on \"Pixelate\" to 32 and check whether text in the image is still readable."
        },
